   "text": "v1 — now\n• Chrome extension (MV3, WXT + React)\n• 4 focus modes\n• AI content-aware blocking\n• Shared content-facts cache + FAISS\n• Free-tier LLM provider chain\n• Block screen, appeal, dot challenge\n• Convince Me (premium)\n• Feed cleanup: YT · IG · X · Reddit\n• Analytics + activity log\n• Sign-in required (Google, email)",
   "originalText": "v1 — now\n• Chrome extension (MV3, WXT + React)\n• 4 focus modes\n• AI content-aware blocking\n• Shared content-facts cache + FAISS\n• Free-tier LLM provider chain\n• Block screen, appeal, dot challenge\n• Convince Me (premium)\n• Feed cleanup: YT · IG · X · Reddit\n• Analytics + activity log\n• Sign-in required (Google, email)",
