   "text": "Files (ai-service/src/ai_service/)\n1  extension (not Python)\n2  embedder.py · later\n3  — · later (FAISS or pgvector)\n4a — · later (Postgres)\n4b describer.py #4 + llm.py #3\n5  — · later\n6  embedder.py #1 + matcher.py #2\n7  matcher.py #2\n8  judge.py #5 + llm.py #3\nglue 4b→8: pipeline.py #6\nHTTP in/out: api.py (done)",
   "originalText": "Files (ai-service/src/ai_service/)\n1  extension (not Python)\n2  embedder.py · later\n3  — · later (FAISS or pgvector)\n4a — · later (Postgres)\n4b describer.py #4 + llm.py #3\n5  — · later\n6  embedder.py #1 + matcher.py #2\n7  matcher.py #2\n8  judge.py #5 + llm.py #3\nglue 4b→8: pipeline.py #6\nHTTP in/out: api.py (done)",
