   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "generated": true
   },
   "text": "Notes\n• The same chain + fallback also guards the describer (4b).\n• Go checks its cached verdict before calling Python,\n  so there is no cache step here.\n• Bad JSON counts as a provider failure → next provider.\n• Spec gap: Verdict.source needs a \"fallback\" value\n  for the tag-parser and allow-and-recheck paths.",
   "originalText": "Notes\n• The same chain + fallback also guards the describer (4b).\n• Go checks its cached verdict before calling Python,\n  so there is no cache step here.\n• Bad JSON counts as a provider failure → next provider.\n• Spec gap: Verdict.source needs a \"fallback\" value\n  for the tag-parser and allow-and-recheck paths.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "pyflow.u_notes",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
